---
// Toast.astro
---
<div id="toast" class="no-print fixed bottom-20 lg:bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 hidden bg-gray-900/95 backdrop-blur-sm text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-xl items-center gap-2 max-w-[90vw] transition-all">
  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shrink-0"></span>
  <span id="toast-message" class="truncate">تغییرات در کوکی ذخیره شد</span>
</div>
